Job Description -&nbsp;

Experience &nbsp;

8+ Years&nbsp;

Role Summary &nbsp;

We are looking for a senior AI Customer Journey Manager to lead the design, optimization, and transformation of customer journeys using AI-driven capabilities. The individual must be highly capable, customer-focused, and able to independently identify opportunities to improve customer experiences through AI and automation. &nbsp;

This role combines customer journey expertise, business analysis, and AI innovation to deliver seamless, personalized, and efficient customer interactions. &nbsp;

Key Responsibilities &nbsp;

• Analyze and map end-to-end customer journeys across digital and assisted channels. &nbsp;

• Identify customer pain points, friction areas, and opportunities for AI-led improvements. &nbsp;

• Define future-state AI-enabled customer experiences and journey enhancements. &nbsp;

• Partner with Product Owners, UX teams, Data Scientists, and Engineering teams to deliver customer-centric AI solutions. &nbsp;

• Develop journey metrics, success measures, and value tracking frameworks. &nbsp;

• Drive customer experience transformation initiatives from concept through implementation. &nbsp;

• Support business case creation for AI-enabled customer engagement initiatives. &nbsp;

• Facilitate stakeholder workshops and customer journey discovery sessions. &nbsp;

• Ensure alignment between customer experience strategy and business objectives. &nbsp;

Required Skills &nbsp;

• 8+ years of experience in Customer Journey Management, Customer Experience (CX), Product Management, Business Analysis, or Digital Transformation. &nbsp;

• Strong experience in customer journey mapping and service design. &nbsp;

• Experience working on AI, automation, conversational AI, or digital customer experience initiatives. &nbsp;

• Strong stakeholder engagement and communication skills. &nbsp;

• Ability to independently drive workshops and solution discussions. &nbsp;

• Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities. &nbsp;

• Experience working in Agile delivery environments. &nbsp;

Preferred Skills &nbsp;

• Banking, Lending, Cards, Mortgages, or Consumer Banking experience. &nbsp;

• Knowledge of AI-powered customer servicing, virtual assistants, personalization, and intelligent automation. &nbsp;

• Familiarity with Customer Experience platforms and analytics tools. &nbsp;

• Understanding of Generative AI, LLMs, Agentic AI, and AI-driven customer engagement strategies. &nbsp;

